# Smuggler's Copter's loot also triggers when it blocks (CR 509.1): Bot2's Ornithopter attacks on turn 4, Llanowar Elves
# crews the Copter once the attack is declared, the Copter blocks it, and the loot draws an Island and discards it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Sol Ring
Llanowar Elves
Smuggler's Copter
Forest
Forest
Forest
Island
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Smuggler's Copter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Activate(Ability: Crew)
Bot1.Block(Smuggler's Copter > Ornithopter)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Choose(Island)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Island
Bot1.Life = 20
